{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p:v2_n_2_2_1:001\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究药物身份：本试验的研究药物为合成药Y。产品身份及其适用特征应可回溯到当前研究者手册或产品权威的版本与定位，不得以历史或未版本化资料替代。当前产品权威的身份版本与定位为【缺口：background.product.authority_identity：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p:v2_n_2_2_1:002\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"适用特征与结构适用性：剂型、规格、理化性质等产品特征为【缺口：framing.product_profile：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。化学结构/分子式的适用性应给出明确结论及理由，不得默认套用结构式描述；当前适用性结论为【缺口：background.product.structure_applicability：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"p:v2_n_2_2_1:003\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"作用机制（声明式补充）：本药作用机制义务继承自 background.mechanism，属于本章的继承性义务与声明式补充；源 @284 仅列研发代号/化学名/结构式/理化性质，未显式含机制表述，不得反向引用源文作为已含证据。本药作用机制为【缺口：background.product.mechanism：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。机制描述应依据独立、可追溯证据，不得直接照抄同类药机制。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"7968949e744c7f3fb15289dd98a316d81751e80f29e443999fd800678f718201"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:7dae483b6a8dd4facaf3add3f5e51e866186d94bd965626f87eeec076e5ba3a4:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:7dae483b6a8dd4facaf3add3f5e51e866186d94bd965626f87eeec076e5ba3a4:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"944b8592037034bdbc1526c1fbf00fdd75e7a9a53678f9548a499bcd61679b30","prompt_sha256":"6ee815045fd91aa16ebcd3eefcf1f4ab03489b3dbfac9ca67d47ce